WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:19.555
The king called Tom to the Throne Room.

2
00:00:19.556 --> 00:00:25.380
"Princess Mary has disappeared!" the king cried.

3
00:00:25.381 --> 00:00:29.295
"I'll find the princess!" Tom said.

4
00:00:29.296 --> 00:00:32.520
He waved his wand. Poof!

5
00:00:32.521 --> 00:00:34.464
There was a puff of smoke.

6
00:00:34.465 --> 00:00:38.023
But nothing else happened.

7
00:00:38.024 --> 00:00:40.236
"Oops," Tom said.

8
00:00:40.237 --> 00:00:45.350
"Wait . . ." Cat sniffed the smoke.

9
00:00:45.351 --> 00:00:48.935
"It smells like trees and moss," she said.

10
00:00:48.936 --> 00:00:51.764
"It smells like the Dark Forest!"

11
00:00:51.765 --> 00:00:55.481
Tom gasped and looked at the king.

12
00:00:55.482 --> 00:00:59.860
"Princess Mary is in the Dark Forest!" Tom said.

13
00:00:59.861 --> 00:01:04.728
"What?" The king turned pale.

14
00:01:04.729 --> 00:01:08.799
"The Dark Forest is dangerous!" he cried.

15
00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:11.776
"We must find the princess at once!"

16
00:01:11.777 --> 00:01:18.459
The king called his knights and guards.

17
00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:21.715
"Search the Dark Forest now!" he said.

18
00:01:21.716 --> 00:01:31.380
"Find Princess Mary!"

19
00:01:31.381 --> 00:01:39.451
The knights and guards crashed through the Dark Forest.

20
00:01:39.452 --> 00:01:45.845
They called loudly for the princess.

21
00:01:45.846 --> 00:01:52.427
But they couldn't find her anywhere.

22
00:01:52.428 --> 00:02:01.195
Finally they returned to the castle.

23
00:02:01.196 --> 00:02:03.711
"Wizard!" the king yelled.

24
00:02:03.712 --> 00:02:06.627
"You must find the princess!"

25
00:02:06.628 --> 00:02:08.964
Tom gulped.

26
00:02:08.965 --> 00:02:20.006
"Yes, Your Majesty."

27
00:02:20.007 --> 00:02:25.252
"I used to live in the Dark Forest," Cat said.

28
00:02:25.253 --> 00:02:27.333
"Follow me."

29
00:02:27.334 --> 00:02:31.175
Tom followed Cat into the Dark Forest.

30
00:02:31.176 --> 00:02:34.915
They looked all around.

31
00:02:34.916 --> 00:02:43.370
"There!" Cat said suddenly.

32
00:02:43.371 --> 00:02:46.298
Tom saw footprints on the ground.

33
00:02:46.299 --> 00:02:51.132
He saw some hoofprints too.

34
00:02:51.133 --> 00:02:59.679
"Princess Mary is with the unicorn!" Cat said.

